# GOLD-01 deliverable 15 — a convenience, NOT the control.
#
# Blind case plaintext is authored in an isolated private directory OUTSIDE this repository (sub-PRD
# D21, breakdown plan §8 Q6 item 4). If an authoring session nonetheless points its working directory
# inside the tree, these patterns stop the plaintext being committed by accident.
#
# The CONTROL is the guard: `BLIND_SEALED` treats a *tracked* file at a `blind/unsealed/**` path, or
# any plaintext under a `blind/` path, as a FAIL and fails the build. An ignore file can be edited,
# bypassed with `git add -f`, or simply not consulted; the guard cannot. Never weaken the guard on
# the grounds that this file exists.
**/blind/unsealed/**
**/*.plaintext.yaml
**/*.plaintext.yml
**/*.plaintext.json
